ewers\" title=\"Lower City Sewers\">Sewers</a> for another kobbo hunt.\n</p>\n</div>    \n<!-- \nNewPP limit report\nCached time: 20260715062145\nCache expiry: 86400\nReduced expiry: false\nComplications: [vary‐revision‐sha1, no‐toc]\nCPU time usage: 0.052 seconds\nReal time usage: 0.054 seconds\nPreprocessor visited node count: 1849/1000000\nPost‐expand include size: 29711/4194304 bytes\nTemplate argument size: 6794/4194304 bytes\nHighest expansion depth: 29/200\nExpensive parser function count: 2/750\nUnstrip recursion depth: 0/20\nUnstrip post‐expand size: 2/5000000 bytes\nExtLoops count: 0/1000\nLua time usage: 0.010/7.000 seconds\nLua memory usage: 936754/52428800 bytes\n-->\n<!--\nTransclusion expansion time report (%,ms,calls,template)\n100.00%   42.325      1 Template:MiscItemPage\n100.00%   42.325      1 -total\n 55.84%   23.635      8 Template:Icon_text\n 48.83%   20.669     19 Template:Trim\n 21.30%    9.017      2 Template:Uid\n 15.46%    6.545      3 Template:Icon_link\n 14.79%    6.258      1 Template:Main_only\n 12.43%    5.262      2 Template:Template_style\n 10.48%    4.437      1 Template:PageSeo\n 10.33%    4.374      2 Template:Hidden_code\n-->\n\n<!-- Saved in parser cache with key bg3wiki:pcache:idhash:46446-0!canonical and timestamp 20260715062145 and revision id 365560. Rendering was triggered because: api-parse\n -->\n</div>"}